== A. the C# node CE joins through the Silica sentinel S
A1 CE asked S for its three stores and S holds CE in its edge store: yes
A2 CE keeps the sentinel it joined through; its sentinel store: 9e1113ab@0
== B. the Silica node A joins through the C# sentinel CS
B1 A asked CS for its three stores and CS holds A in its edge store: yes
B2 A keeps the sentinel it joined through; its sentinel store: e4188f0a@0
== C. shuffles started by each side and answered by the other
C1 a peer shuffles an entry for x2 (age 3) into CE; CE's edge store: 12eb7f44@3
C2 a peer shuffles CE's entry (age 5) into A; A's edge store: 1fae2ad7@5
C3 A ticks: it shuffles with CE, which answers with x2; A's edge store: 12eb7f44@3
C3 CE holds A, whose entry came in the shuffle; CE's edge store: b19edad2@0 12eb7f44@3
C4 CE ticks: its oldest entry is x2, where nobody listens; the partner is dropped, the entry sent is put back; CE's edge store: b19edad2@1
C5 CE ticks: it shuffles with A, which answers; A's edge store: 1fae2ad7@0 12eb7f44@3
C5 CE's edge store: 12eb7f44@3
C6 S ticks its edge store, which is not of its own type: it shuffles with CE without an entry of its own and keeps CE: merged
C7 CS ticks its edge store: it shuffles with A and puts A back at age 0 (ruling NQ-15); CS's edge view: b19edad2@0 12eb7f44@3 1fae2ad7@0
C8 CE ticks its sentinel store: it shuffles with S, a sentinel of its whitelist: merged
C9 A ticks its sentinel store: it shuffles with CS, a sentinel of its whitelist: merged
